<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air cargo volumes up 26 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air cargo volumes up 26 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose 26 percent in February to 28,565 tonnes from 22,695 tonnes in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose almost four percent to 2,805 tonnes from 2,705 tonnes in February 1996.</p>
<p>Last year the airport handled 320,607 tonnes of cargo, a 19 percent rise on the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
